    "content": "\n<div style=\"height:51px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer ticss-182d931e\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-49\" style=\"color:#043570\">Credentialing Team Lead</h1>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"job-options\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-laptop-24-e1786525369335.png\" alt=\"location pune\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-right:0px;\">\nRemote\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-bag-24-e1786525391832.png\" alt=\"experience 2+ years\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\">\n1-4 yrs\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-money-24-e1786525352463.png\" alt=\"salary INR 40000 to 70000\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\">\nNot Disclosed\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-clock-24-e1786525403937.png\" alt=\"posted today\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\"> \nPosted Today\n</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a8a1933 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-b192c3d7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-outline is-style-outline--7\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-5-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-border-color has-ast-global-color-5-border-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://mantracomply.com/apply-now/?profile=Credentialing%20Team%20Lead\" style=\"background-color:#00c0ff;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px\">Apply Now</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:5px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-50 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong>About MantraComply</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-51 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.6\">MantraComply is a healthcare technology and services company that helps healthcare organizations manage provider credentialing, licensing, payer enrollment, compliance and other healthcare operations. We combine technology, automation and healthcare expertise to simplify administrative processes and help providers complete credentialing and enrollment requirements efficiently.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-52 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong><strong>Role Overview</strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-53 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.6\">We are looking for an experienced <strong>Credentialing Team Lead</strong> to manage a team responsible for US healthcare credentialing and provider enrollment operations.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-54 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong><strong><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left:30px\" class=\"wp-block-list has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-55\">\n<li>Lead and manage a team of credentialing and enrollment specialists.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Allocate providers and applications across the team.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitor productivity, turnaround time, quality, and SLA performance.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Review credentialing and enrollment applications for accuracy.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Handle escalations and complex credentialing cases.Train and mentor new team members.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Develop and maintain SOPs and process documentation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Identify process bottlenecks and implement improvements.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Coordinate with Client Success and Implementation teams.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitor payer and provider follow-ups.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Prepare operational reports and performance dashboards.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure compliance with internal quality standards and applicable credentialing requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-56 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left:30px\" class=\"wp-block-list has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-57\">\n<li>4\u20137 years of experience in US healthcare credentialing/provider enrollment.1\u20133 years of team leadership experience preferred.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong understanding of CAQH, NPI, Medicare, Medicaid, and commercial payers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experience working with SLAs, productivity metrics, and quality metrics.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a8a1933 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-outline is-style-outline--8\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-5-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-border-color has-ast-global-color-5-border-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://mantracomply.com/apply-now/?profile=Credentialing%20Team%20Lead\" style=\"background-color:#00c0ff;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px\">Apply Now</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n"
