    "content": "\n<div style=\"height:51px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer ticss-182d931e\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-65\" style=\"color:#043570\">Provider Enrollment Specialist</h1>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:10px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"job-options\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-laptop-24-e1786525369335.png\" alt=\"location pune\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-right:0px;\">\nRemote\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-bag-24-e1786525391832.png\" alt=\"experience 2+ years\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\">\n1-4 yrs\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-money-24-e1786525352463.png\" alt=\"salary INR 40000 to 70000\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\">\nNot Disclosed\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://mantracomply.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/icons8-clock-24-e1786525403937.png\" alt=\"posted today\" width=\"20px;\" height=\"20px;\" style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:0px;\"> \nPosted Today\n</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a8a1933 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-b192c3d7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-outline is-style-outline--9\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-5-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-border-color has-ast-global-color-5-border-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://mantracomply.com/apply-now/?profile=Provider%20Enrollment%20Specialist\" style=\"background-color:#00c0ff;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px\">Apply Now</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:5px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-66 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong>About MantraComply</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-67 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.6\">MantraComply is a healthcare technology and services company that helps healthcare organizations manage provider credentialing, licensing, payer enrollment, compliance and other healthcare operations. We combine technology, automation and healthcare expertise to simplify administrative processes and help providers complete credentialing and enrollment requirements efficiently.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-68 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong><strong>Role Overview</strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-69 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"line-height:1.6\">We are looking for a <strong>Provider Enrollment Specialist</strong> to manage enrollment of healthcare providers with US insurance payers and government programs.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-70 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong><strong><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left:30px\" class=\"wp-block-list has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-71\">\n<li>Prepare and submit provider enrollment applications to commercial and government payers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manage Medicare, Medicaid, and commercial payer enrollment processes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maintain accurate provider demographics, tax information, NPI, practice locations, and other enrollment data.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Coordinate with providers and practices to obtain required documents.Track applications from submission through approval.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow up with payer enrollment departments on pending applications.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Resolve application rejections, discrepancies, and requests for additional information.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maintain enrollment trackers and update internal systems.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Support revalidation and re-enrollment activities.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure enrollment work meets turnaround-time and quality standards.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b62443b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-color:#00c0ff;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-72 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#043570\"><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left:30px\" class=\"wp-block-list has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-73\">\n<li>1\u20134 years of experience in US provider enrollment or credentialing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding of Medicare, Medicaid, commercial payer enrollment, NPI, and CAQH.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong attention to detail.Excellent written and spoken English.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong follow-up and organizational skills.Ability to manage multiple applications and deadlines.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a8a1933 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-outline is-style-outline--10\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-5-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-border-color has-ast-global-color-5-border-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https://mantracomply.com/apply-now/?profile=Provider%20Enrollment%20Specialist\" style=\"background-color:#00c0ff;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px\">Apply Now</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n"
